### Real browser journeys
Use real supported UI and keyboard/mouse/touch inputs where practical.

Verify:
1. Start a fresh campaign.
2. Learn Chrono Edge.
3. Switch to Pulsecaster.
4. Fire at an enemy, hit and miss intentionally.
5. Charge and release the signature attack.
6. Switch back to Chrono Edge and perform a melee combo.
