9. Verify mobile weapon switching, movement, camera orbit, attack buttons and Echo interaction.
10. Verify the current four GLBs still load and no new console/page errors occur.

Use test hooks only for reproducible setup or observation. Do not claim that a forced HP value is a player-earned kill. Clearly distinguish real-input browser verification from test fixtures.

Run the current simulation, reduced-motion, campaign-release and asset-lifecycle tests alongside the new tests.

